// Title: Drop Binaries Into Spool Drivers Color Folder
// Rule ID: ce7066a6-508a-42d3-995b-2952c65dc2ce
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
